  m_Text: An exciting 2D mobile game where the player controls a small plane, trying
    to survive as long as possible in the sky, full of dangers. You have to dodge
    other planes flying in different directions, avoid collisions with giant birds
    and fly through thick clouds. Your goal is to hold out as long as possible, gaining
    points for each successful evasive maneuver and collecting bonuses that will
    help you survive. With each second, the game becomes more and more intense, creating
    an exciting experience and making you want to beat your own record. Control your
    plane boldly and dexterously to become a true master of the skies in "Avia Sky
    Destiny!"
